<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S TAFI WINS TOUR OF LOMBARDY.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S TAFI WINS TOUR OF LOMBARDY.</headline>
<dateline>BERGAMO, Italy 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Andrea Tafi won the 250-km Tour of Lombardy cycling race on Saturday.</p>
<p>Fabian Jeker of Switzerland was second and Axel Merckx of Belgium was third.</p>
</text>
